(text "TPS2553 current limit 24k: about 1.0-1.2 A; FAULT_N is shared with the other channels (one red LED on the power sheet). LM66100 ideal diode to the link header. Pull the LINK jumper before plugging node USB. 2.2k series resistors keep a powered P4 from back-feeding an unpowered node through its pins." (at 15 20 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b42c2d26-4c8c-567e-9df6-110253afd627"))
